      mon: ['aPTT or anti-Xa 6 h after every change and daily; platelets daily (HIT: a fall > 50% or a new thrombosis day 5–10 — 4Ts score, stop heparin, argatroban/bivalirudin)', 'Bleeding; haemoglobin; the access sites', 'Antithrombin deficiency (heparin resistance: rising doses with no aPTT response) — anti-Xa, antithrombin, or switch to a direct thrombin inhibitor'],
